==English==
{{slim-wikipedia|Plaice (disambiguation)}}
[[File:Hippoglossoides platessoides.jpg|thumb|''Hippoglossoides platessoides''<br>American '''plaice''']]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|plaiz}}, from {{etyl|Late Latin|en}} {{m|la|platessa}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|πλατύς||broad}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|plās}}, {{IPA|/pleɪs/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|eɪs|lang=en}}
* {{homophones|lang=en|place}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|plaice|plaices}}

# The large marine [[flatfish]], ''[[Pleuronectes platessa]]'', commonly found in the [[North Sea]] and [[Irish Sea]], with smooth brown skin and red or orange spots.
# The [[flatfish]], {{taxlink|Hippoglossoides platessoides|species|noshow=1}}, of the North American [[Atlantic]]; the {{vern|American plaice|pedia=1}}.

